+# Custom Autolearn Documentation
+
+The custom autolearn system replaces experimental post-stop LLM capture with a deterministic, evidence-based sidecar verifier, SQLite candidate ledger, secret redaction, and promotion lifecycle into Mnemopi memory and managed skills.
+
+## Configuration (`autolearn.*`)
+
+Autolearn is configured via standard OMP settings (`~/.omp/agent/config.yml` or `settings.json`):
+
+```yaml
+# Learning architecture mode: off (default) | builtin | custom
+autolearn.mode: custom
+
+# Minimum verified passes required to promote a rule/fact into memory
+autolearn.minPassesRule: 2
+
+# Minimum verified passes required to generate a managed SKILL.md
+autolearn.minPassesSkill: 3
+
+# Default scope for created candidates: local | project | global
+autolearn.defaultScope: project
+
+# Mint managed skills under ~/.omp/agent/managed-skills
+autolearn.mintSkills: true
+
+# Custom regex patterns for secret / token redaction
+autolearn.redactPatterns:
+  - "secret-[a-zA-Z0-9]+"
+```
+
+### Precedence & Compatibility
+- `autolearn.mode: "custom"` activates the sidecar verifier and candidate ledger. It automatically disables the built-in `AutoLearnController` and overrides `mnemopi.autoRetain` to `false`.
+- `autolearn.mode: "builtin"` or legacy `autolearn.enabled: true` retains the experimental built-in LLM capture turn.
+- `autolearn.mode: "off"` (default) leaves autolearn inactive.
+
+## Architecture
+
+1. **Sidecar SQLite Database (`learn.db`)**: Mode 0600, WAL mode, foreign keys, and busy timeout.
+   - `candidates`: structured candidates with versions, pass counts, and projection pointers.
+   - `verdicts`: verifier results (pass/fail/inconclusive).
+   - `learn_events`: append-only audit trail.
+   - `tombstones`: deleted/rejected signatures to prevent resurrection.
+   - `episodes`: session metadata.
+
+2. **Verifier & Exact Correlation**:
+   - `isError=false` alone is treated as inconclusive.
+   - Promotion requires an exact pre-registered failure signature followed by a matching verifier pass.
+   - Command parameters, paths, and outputs are redacted at all persistence boundaries.
+
+3. **Mnemopi Integration (`ctx.memory.edit` / `ctx.memory.save`)**:
+   - Promoted candidates project into Mnemopi with source `omp-autolearn`.
+   - Candidate deletion executes `ctx.memory.edit("forget", projectedId)` and writes a tombstone.
+
+4. **Managed Skills**:
+   - Procedures reaching `minPassesSkill` write to `~/.omp/agent/managed-skills/<name>/SKILL.md` under safe size and naming constraints.
+
+## Slash Commands
+
+- `/learn status` — view candidate statistics and active mode.
+- `/learn view [id]` — list candidates or inspect candidate details.
+- `/learn approve <id>` — manually approve and promote a candidate.
+- `/learn delete <id>` — delete candidate, forget projected memory, and write tombstone.
+- `/learn config` — display active configuration values.
